{
  "_id": "tg-water",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Spirit of God moved upon the face of the waters, Gen. 1:2 (Moses 2:2). divided the waters … from the waters which were above, Gen. 1:7 (Moses 2:7; Abr. 4:6). Let the waters … be gathered together, Gen. 1:9 (Moses 2:9; Abr. 4:9). herdmen … saying, The water is ours, Gen. 26:20. Moses … Because I drew him out of the water, Ex. 2:10. waters … in the river were turned to blood, Ex. 7:20. three days in the wilderness, and found no water, Ex. 15:22. smite the rock, and there shall come water out, Ex. 17:6 (Deut. 8:15; Ps. 78:20; Isa. 48:21; 1 Ne. 17:29; 2 Ne. 25:20). priest shall take holy water, Num. 5:17. no water for the congregation, Num. 20:2. are as water spilt on the ground, 2 Sam. 14:14. feed … with water of affliction, 1 Kgs. 22:27 (2 Chr. 18:26). Elijah took his mantle … and smote the waters, 2 Kgs. 2:8. axe head fell into the water, 2 Kgs. 6:5. waters wear the stones, Job 14:19. He bindeth up the waters in his thick clouds, Job 26:8. he leadeth me beside the still waters, Ps. 23:2. Thou visitest the earth, and waterest it, Ps. 65:9. Counsel in the heart of man is like deep water, Prov. 20:5. As cold waters to a thirsty soul, so is good news, Prov. 25:25. Cast thy bread upon the waters, Eccl. 11:1. full of the knowledge of the Lord, as the waters cover the sea, Isa. 11:9 (Hab. 2:14). draw water out of the wells of salvation, Isa. 12:3 (2 Ne. 22:3). waters shall overflow the hiding place, Isa. 28:17. his waters shall be sure, Isa. 33:16. in the wilderness shall waters break out, Isa. 35:6. When the poor and needy seek water … God of Israel will not forsake them, Isa. 41:17. When thou passest through the waters, I will be with thee, Isa. 43:2. I will pour water upon him that is thirsty, Isa. 44:3. come forth out of the waters of Judah, Isa. 48:1 (1 Ne. 20:1). this is as the waters of Noah unto me, Isa. 54:9. every one that thirsteth, come ye to the waters, Isa. 55:1. God hath … given us water of gall, Jer. 8:14. I will also water with thy blood, Ezek. 32:6. will I sprinkle clean water upon you, Ezek. 36:25. waters issued out from under the threshold, Ezek. 47:1. let judgment run down as waters, Amos 5:24.",
