      "text": "baptize you with water unto repentance, Matt. 3:11 (Mark 1:8; Luke 3:16; John 1:26). give to drink … a cup of cold water, Matt. 10:42 (Mark 9:41). Pilate … took water, and washed his hands, Matt. 27:24. that he may dip the tip of his finger in water, Luke 16:24. Jesus saith … Fill the waterpots with water, John 2:7. Except a man be born of water and of the Spirit, John 3:5 (Moses 6:59). blind, halt, withered, waiting for the moving of the water, John 5:3. pierced his side … came there out blood and water, John 19:34. John truly baptized with water, Acts 1:5 (11:16). eunuch said, See, here is water, Acts 8:36. Can any man forbid water, Acts 10:47. I have planted, Apollos watered, 1 Cor. 3:6. same place sweet water and bitter, James 3:11. eight souls were saved by water, 1 Pet. 3:20 (D&C 138:9). wells without water, 2 Pet. 2:17. earth standing out of the water and in the water, 2 Pet. 3:5. not by water only, but by water and blood, 1 Jn. 5:6. third part of the waters became wormwood, Rev. 8:11. waters which thou sawest … are peoples, Rev. 17:15. I will give … of the fountain of the water of life, Rev. 21:6. shewed me a pure river of water of life, Rev. 22:1. whosoever will, let him take the water of life, Rev. 22:17.",
